Package: tuiksdmx
Title: Access the Turkish Statistical Institute SDMX REST API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Muhammed Fatih", "Tuzen",
           email = "mfatihtuzen@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an authenticated, metadata-driven R client for the
    Turkish Statistical Institute (TURKSTAT) SDMX REST API. Supports
    dataflow discovery, data structure definitions, concepts, codelists,
    metadata-based filter validation, SDMX query construction, statistical
    data retrieval, and observation-based availability exploration.
    Authentication supports an environment variable or an explicitly
    supplied API key argument.
URL: https://github.com/MFatihTuzen/tuiksdmx,
 https://MFatihTuzen.github.io/tuiksdmx/
BugReports: https://github.com/MFatihTuzen/tuiksdmx/issues
